# Assistive Tech (AT) Directory

For my project, I researched and documented many potential resources for Assistive Tech based primarily on the regions they serviced and the populations they served. My focus was specifically on my local city (Concord) and county (Contra Costa County). However I included a handful of other resources for other regions when they came up in my searches and looked generally promising as well. I plan on sharing this basic directory with my classmates, and they can potentially use it as a template or even suggest additions based on their own regions to make the directory more broadly useful. 

I think that's enough of an intro, especially since there's a dedicated "Reflection" project for this, so if you're ready you can [Open the directory](index.md).
